{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1378041-group-bunks","id":1378041,"title":"Group Bunks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-02T14:06:55-07:00","id":1378041,"title":"Group Bunks","content":"Something I hadn't anticipated, and isn't in the rules anywhere, is that when one of my PCs casts a cantrip, the entire group stops what they're doing and participates in the Bunk. They've done production song-and-dance numbers as though they were living in a Broadway or movie musical. I just messaged them that the Dreaming is demanding they up the ante and provide lights, sound, or pyrotechnics the next time, or it isn't going to get full value. <br /> Has anyone else had players do this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12930-gogariglenross","name":"GogariGlenRoss","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-02T14:21:34-07:00","id":1378045,"title":"","content":"I've never seen it happen as a major production but as an ST I'd probably be willing to add a bonus of something.<br /> <br /> Maybe a bonus die depending on the number of fae involved, capped by the highest fae realm available. I could also see an additional difficulty reduction from -1 to -3 based on the scale of the group bunk.<br /> <br /> But I'm not a mechanically minded person, so... YMMV.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-04T06:30:07-07:00","id":1378517,"title":"","content":"Seems like a good thing to me. I'd give them a bonus.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-04T14:07:01-07:00","id":1378614,"title":"","content":"I have. Improvising a song seems low-impact, but three people co-ordinating, and taking several turns to do it, adds up to a -3 Bunk. Especially given that the entire party effectively surrender their turns when they do this. I capped it at 3, since I think level 4 and 5 Bunks need to be particularly challenging or risky.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12930-gogariglenross","name":"GogariGlenRoss","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}